s.8.7\">2 Ch 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:1\" href=\"/Ezra.9.1\">Ezr 9:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.8\">Ne 9:8</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.3\">Ez 16:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:45\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.45\">45</a>; (on these lists cf. Bu<sup>Urgesch 344 ff.</sup> & We<sup>JBTh xxi. 602</sup>.)"}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong> adj.gent.</strong> sg. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:13\" href=\"/Genesis.14.13\">Gn 14:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.24\">Dt 2:24</a>."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB00630","strong_numbers":["567"],"next_hw":"אִמְרִי","prev_hw":"אִמֵּר","quotes":[],"GK":["616"],"TWOT":["119"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}